# PR #1210 (fix/aw-readiness-contracts) status, quality-mgr 2026-09-05: the
# no-op/idempotency guard IS implemented and tested (sequential-call test
# attach_timeline_second_call_does_not_replace_the_active_writer). Remains
# open because no test exercises the genuine concurrent OnceLock::set() race
# via thread::spawn -- only sequential re-calls are proven. Keep open until a
# multi-thread race test is added.

